:: Manor Study
You peruse the wall of books looking for anything relevant. Among the mostly water damaged books, you manage to find something relevant. It seems old and likely outdated, but you may be able to parse some understanding from these textbooks anyway.
<br><br>
You settle down and turn on the study's lantern which flickers to life as you begin to read.
<br><br>
